              <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">{s.name}</span>
              <span class="mt-0.5 block text-xs leading-relaxed text-ops-muted">{s.note}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <h3 class="mt-14 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-50">Pages out to where you already are</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ops-subtle">
        Twenty ways to reach people, each with a link straight to the incident. The three outlined in blue get buttons,
        so you can acknowledge, escalate, or start a session without leaving the chat.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5" aria-label="Notification platforms">
        {platforms.map((p) => (
          <li class={`flex items-start gap-3.5 rounded-lg border bg-ops-surface/60 p-4 transition-colors ${p.buttons ? 'border-ops-blue/50 hover:border-ops-blue' : 'border-ops-border hover:border-slate-500'}`}>
