            <span class="min-w-0">
              <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-50">{p.name}</span>
              <span class={`mt-0.5 block text-xs leading-relaxed ${p.buttons ? 'text-ops-blue' : 'text-ops-muted'}`}>{p.note}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-10 max-w-2xl text-sm text-ops-muted">
        The same idea runs through the rest of the product. Seven model providers, twenty six connectors, any MCP server
        you care to run, and deploy recipes for AWS, Azure, Google Cloud, and OCI. Your tools, your keys, your servers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

